#: ../installation/prerequis.rst:8
msgid "Prerequisites and hosting"
msgstr "Preduvjeti i smještaj"

#: ../installation/prerequis.rst:10
msgid "To install Galette, you will need to meet the following requirements :"
msgstr "Za instalaciju Galettea trebate ispuniti sljedeće zahtjeve:"

#: ../installation/prerequis.rst:12
msgid "a web server (like Apache),"
msgstr "mrežni poslužitelj, primjerice Apache,"

#: ../installation/prerequis.rst:13
msgid "PHP 8.3 or more recent,"
msgstr "PHP 8.3 ili noviji,"

#: ../installation/prerequis.rst:15
msgid "`ctype`, `dom`, `fileinfo`, `filter`, `gd`, `gettext`, `iconv`, `intl`, `mbstring` and `session`,"
msgstr ""
"`ctype`, `dom`, `fileinfo`, `filter`, `gd`, `gettext`, `iconv`, `intl`, "
"`mbstring` i `session`,"

#: ../installation/prerequis.rst:16
msgid "`PDO`, with `pdo_mysql` or `pdo_pgsql` depending on your database,"
msgstr "`PDO`, s `pdo_mysql` ili `pdo_pgsql`, ovisno o bazi podataka,"

#: ../installation/prerequis.rst:17
msgid "`curl` and `openssl` are recommended, but not required (`curl` is for example used to call a :ref:`post contribution script <man_preferences>` over HTTP)."
msgstr ""
"`curl` i `openssl` preporučeni su, ali nisu obvezni (`curl` se, primjerice, "
"koristi za HTTP poziv :ref:`skripte nakon uplate <man_preferences>`)."

#: ../installation/prerequis.rst:19
msgid "A database server, `MariaDB <https://mariadb.org>`_ 10.5 minimum (or MySQL 8.0 minimum), or `PostgreSQL <https://postgresql.org>`_ 13 minimum."
msgstr ""
"poslužitelj baze podataka: `MariaDB <https://mariadb.org>`_ najmanje verzije "
"10.5 (ili MySQL najmanje 8.0) ili `PostgreSQL <https://postgresql.org>`_ "
"najmanje verzije 13."

#: ../installation/prerequis.rst:21
msgid "A recent web browser with Javascript enabled is also required to use Galette."
msgstr ""
"Za korištenje Galettea potreban je i noviji mrežni preglednik s uključenim "
"JavaScriptom."

#: ../installation/prerequis.rst:23
msgid "Galette is tested continuously with recent versions of these components. If you encounter issues with a recent version, please let us know ;)"
msgstr ""
"Galette se stalno testira s novijim verzijama tih komponenti. Ako naiđete na "
"problem s novijom verzijom, javite nam ;)"

#: ../installation/prerequis.rst:25
msgid "Galette does not work on the following hostings:"
msgstr "Galette ne radi kod sljedećih pružatelja smještaja:"

#: ../installation/prerequis.rst:27
msgid "Free,"
msgstr "Free,"

#: ../installation/prerequis.rst:28
msgid "Olympe Networks."
msgstr "Olympe Networks."
